    {
      "subId": "7103507",
      "subQuestName": "Go back to the Pervases statue",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [],
        "dialogs": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7103508",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Wang Ping'an",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "710350401"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "710350401": {
            "id": "710350401",
            "speakerId": 12326,
            "speakerName": "Wang Ping'an",
            "text": "This temple is in a terrible state...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710350402"
            ]
          },
          "710350402": {
            "id": "710350402",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Alright, mister, where did you suddenly get the idea to come and fix this temple?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710350403"
            ]
          },
          "710350403": {
            "id": "710350403",
            "speakerId": 12326,
            "speakerName": "Wang Ping'an",
            "text": "Heh... Well, that's a long story...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710350404"
            ]
          },
          "710350404": {
            "id": "710350404",
            "speakerId": 12326,
            "speakerName": "Wang Ping'an",
            "text": "Back when I was pretending to be an adeptus, I gathered a lot of resources to help me keep up the act...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710350405"
            ]
          },
          "710350405": {
            "id": "710350405",
            "speakerId": 12326,
            "speakerName": "Wang Ping'an",
            "text": "But remember how I swore to do good after that adeptus taught me a lesson? Well, after I returned, I was planning to destroy all those materials of mine.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710350406"
            ]
          },
          "710350406": {
            "id": "710350406",
            "speakerId": 12326,
            "speakerName": "Wang Ping'an",
            "text": "But then I had a thought... Rather than destroying all this information, wouldn't it be better to write up my code of charlatanry and share it with others?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710350407"
            ]
          },
          "710350407": {
            "id": "710350407",
            "speakerId": 12326,
            "speakerName": "Wang Ping'an",
            "text": "That way, I can help others to see through scams and cheaters...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710350408"
            ]
          },
          "710350408": {
            "id": "710350408",
            "speakerId": 12326,
            "speakerName": "Wang Ping'an",
            "text": "To my surprise, the guidebook I wrote proved helpful to a lot of people. Even the Ministry of Civil Affairs said that it was very useful.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710350409"
            ]
          },
          "710350409": {
            "id": "710350409",
            "speakerId": 12326,
            "speakerName": "Wang Ping'an",
            "text": "They even provided me with some additional scam countermeasures to add to the stuff that I'd written myself...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710350410"
            ]
          },
          "710350410": {
            "id": "710350410",
            "speakerId": 12326,
            "speakerName": "Wang Ping'an",
            "text": "To that end, they paid me a pretty hefty sum.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710350411"
            ]
          },
          "710350411": {
            "id": "710350411",
            "speakerId": 12326,
            "speakerName": "Wang Ping'an",
            "text": "Apart from that guidebook, I'm currently planning to write a book about the Vigilant Yaksha.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710350412"
            ]
          },
          "710350412": {
            "id": "710350412",
            "speakerId": 12326,
            "speakerName": "Wang Ping'an",
            "text": "Its purpose, of course, is to share the stories of the Vigilant Yaksha with as many people as possible.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710350413"
            ]
          },
          "710350413": {
            "id": "710350413",
            "speakerId": 12326,
            "speakerName": "Wang Ping'an",
            "text": "That way, I'll be able to put the folklore knowledge I possess to good use.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710350414"
            ]
          },
          "710350414": {
            "id": "710350414",
            "speakerId": 12326,
            "speakerName": "Wang Ping'an",
            "text": "As for this temple to Pervases, I discovered it while I was compiling material for this second book.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710350415"
            ]
          },
          "710350415": {
            "id": "710350415",
            "speakerId": 12326,
            "speakerName": "Wang Ping'an",
            "text": "I found sources saying that this temple was built by our forebears to remember the Yaksha, Pervases.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710350416"
            ]
          },
          "710350416": {
            "id": "710350416",
            "speakerId": 12326,
            "speakerName": "Wang Ping'an",
            "text": "But I never expected to find the temple in such a state of disrepair...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710350417"
            ]
          },
          "710350417": {
            "id": "710350417",
            "speakerId": 12326,
            "speakerName": "Wang Ping'an",
            "text": "When I returned and thought about it, I decided to fund the repair of this temple from my own pocket.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710350418"
            ]
          },
          "710350418": {
            "id": "710350418",
            "speakerId": 12326,
            "speakerName": "Wang Ping'an",
            "text": "After all, I, too, was guided back to the right path by an adeptus.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710350419"
            ]
          },
          "710350419": {
            "id": "710350419",
            "speakerId": 12326,
            "speakerName": "Wang Ping'an",
            "text": "I suppose repairing this temple can be considered atonement for my previous wrongdoings.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710350420"
            ]
          },
          "710350420": {
            "id": "710350420",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Hmm... sounds genuine enough...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710350421"
            ]
          },
          "710350421": {
            "id": "710350421",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "#What do you think, {NICKNAME}?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710350423",
              "710350425"
            ]
          },
          "710350423": {
            "id": "710350423",
            "speakerId": 12326,
            "speakerName": "Wang Ping'an",
            "text": "What do you mean \"kinda\"? I AM being genuine! One hundred percent genuine!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710350426"
            ]
          },
          "710350426": {
            "id": "710350426",
            "speakerId": 12326,
            "speakerName": "Wang Ping'an",
            "text": "*sigh* Oh, fine, think whatever you like.",
